    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ocean City Killer</strong> is an open-world corporate dungeon crawler. You play as <strong>Rick Atlanta</strong>, a private eye investigating the death of a former colleague. What starts out as a routine case pulls you into the dark labyrinth of a seedy megacorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty <strong>1990s computer</strong> to scour the net for leads, tap into intel with your <strong>cellular phone</strong>, and equip yourself with an arsenal of weapons and gadgets. Explore a <strong>top-down city</strong>, forge alliances, and uncover secrets\u2014but <strong>be careful who you trust</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you sneak through the shadows or charge in guns blazing? <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around Ocean City in your upgradable muscle car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak or fight your way through numerous office dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new weapons, gadgets, and clues to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to interact with a wide array of different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull out your state-of-the-art cellular phone to call people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on to the net to find leads</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ocean City Killer</strong> is an open-world corporate dungeon crawler. You play as <strong>Rick Atlanta</strong>, a private eye investigating the death of a former colleague. What starts out as a routine case pulls you into the dark labyrinth of a seedy megacorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty <strong>1990s computer</strong> to scour the net for leads, tap into intel with your <strong>cellular phone</strong>, and equip yourself with an arsenal of weapons and gadgets. Explore a <strong>top-down city</strong>, forge alliances, and uncover secrets\u2014but <strong>be careful who you trust</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you sneak through the shadows or charge in guns blazing? <strong>The choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An all-original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive around Ocean City in your upgradable muscle car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak or fight your way through numerous office dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get new weapons, gadgets, and clues to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to interact with a wide array of different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull out your state-of-the-art cellular phone to call people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on to the net to find leads</p></li></ul>",
